      "review_summary": "The PR adds a 100 MiB cap by reading the opened sandbox file descriptor in 64 KiB synchronous chunks before returning its contents.\n\nPR surface: Source +28. Total +28 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: no. high-confidence live reproduction was supplied or run. The prior unbounded `FileHandle.readFile()` path and the new synchronous replacement are clear from the reviewed diff, so the concern is source-reproducible.",
